  "note": "Start from clearframe ingest --markdown report.md: it writes BRIEF.md with every figure, its sentence and its source. Replace every sample claim and keep one dataset: the same label always shows the same value and unit. Lead with the surprising figure, ask the question it raises, draw the mechanism (don't list it), show the evidence as a chart that changes on the cue, then turn. Charts fill the frame without headings: chart.note says what to look at, on the stressed word.",
